@operatorToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoib3BlcmF0b3JfMDEiLCJyb2xlIjoiT1BFUkFUT1IiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzYxMjc0NDAsImV4cCI6MTc3NjE1NjI0MH0.tC67149iebHB1qGWmE-57nnZbTh6V8x0-4ivy_QCKkA

### Production history with operator access (should be 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/production?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Production history with filters (date + spout)
GET {{baseUrl}}/production?page=1&limit=20&startDate=2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2026-04-30T23:59:59.999Z&spout_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Production history invalid range (should be 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/production?startDate=2026-04-30T23:59:59.999Z&endDate=2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Production history missing token (should be 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/production?page=1&limit=20

### Alarm history all
GET {{baseUrl}}/alarms?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Alarm history Active only
GET {{baseUrl}}/alarms?page=1&limit=20&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Alarm history Cleared only with date filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/alarms?page=1&limit=20&status=Cleared&startDate=2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2026-04-30T23:59:59.999Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Alarm history invalid status (should be 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alarms?status=Unknown
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### KPI aggregation for current day (admin only — needs ADMIN token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### KPI aggregation with operator token (should be 403 — analytics is admin-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Production chart by hour for current day (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/production-chart
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Set price per tonne (admin only; persists in dashboard_settings)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/analytics/pricing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price_per_ton_tnd": 275.5
}

### SQLi-style spout_id attempt should fail validation (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/production?spout_id=1%20OR%201=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
